        {
          "id": "contract:05",
          "kind": "project_contract",
          "text": "`signed_value = quantity * unit_price` uses decimal arithmetic, with no per-line\npenny rounding before aggregation. Round only presentation totals. This is an\ninvoice-line value proxy, not audited accounting revenue, gross margin, profit,\nVAT, conversion, stock availability or sales attributable to an intervention.",
